## Specifications

-   TypeFlatbed Scanner
-   Scanning elementCIS
-   Light source3-color (RGB) LED
-   Optical resolution4800 x 4800dpi[1](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-1)
-   Selectable resolution25 – 19200dpi[2](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-2)
-   InterfaceUSB-Type C (USB 3.0 and 2.0 compatible)
-   Scanning gradation (colour)48 bit input -> 48/24 bit output
-   Scanning gradation (greyscale)16 bit input -> 8 bit output
-   Maximum Document SizeA4 / Letter (216 x 297mm)
-   EZ-Scan Buttons5 buttons (PDF x 2, AUTOSCAN, COPY, SEND)
-   Scanning speed**(colour)**  
    (Reflective)  
    25.4msec/line (4800 dpi)  
    14.8msec/line (2400 dpi)  
    6.6msec/line (1200 dpi)  
    3.8msec/line (600 dpi)  
    1.7msec/line (300 dpi)[3](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-3)  

    **(greyscale, B&W)**  
    (Reflective）  
    8.2msec/line (4800 dpi)  
    4.3msec/line (2400 dpi)  
    2.2msec/line (1200 dpi)  
    1.3msec/line (600 dpi)  
    1.7msec/line (300 dpi)[4](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-4)
-   Scan speed (A4, 300dpi, Colour)Approx. 8 sec[5](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-5)
-   Scan speed (4×6″, 300dpi, Colour)Approx. 4 sec[6](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-6)
-   Preview SpeedApprox. 7 sec[7](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-7)
-   Software IncludedScan Gear for Win  
    Scan Utility for Win
-   Power SupplySupplied via USB port
-   Power Consumptionapprox. 4.5W (in operation, maximum)  
    approx. 0.3W (standby)
-   Dimensions250 × 367 × 42 mm
-   Weight1.7kg
-   Operating Temperature range5 – 35 °C
-   Operating Humidity Range10 – 90 %RH, without condensation formation
-   Supported Operating SystemsWindows 10、Windows 8.1、Windows 7 SP1[8](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-8)[9](https://www.canon-europe.com/support/consumer/products/scanners/canoscan/lide-series/canoscan-lide-400.html?type=specifications#footnote-9)  
    Operation can only be guaranteed on a PC with pre-installed Windows 7 or later.   
    OS X 10.11.6、macOS 10.12〜10.15, macOS 11 \*
-   Minimum System RequirementsDisplay: 1024 x 768 XGA
